# Provider agnostic

- Load `model.provider` and `model.id` from `harness/knobs.yaml` or Harbor configurable.
- Python: `init_chat_model`. TypeScript: `initChatModel`.
- Do not import `ChatOpenAI` as the only path unless init locked `openai`.
- Do not default to OpenAI or Grok if provider is `unset` — stop and ask.
- Grok + Cursor SDK as two clients is [cursor-grok-factory](https://github.com/jxtngx/cursor-grok-factory).
